name: review-of-fkwu-runtime
is: All 39 claims of 3.6.kg (26 observations, 13 findings) were read against their sources: 27 confirmed, 12 amended (3.6.1.4, 3.6.1.9, 3.6.2.1, 3.6.2.2, 3.6.2.3, 3.6.2.6, 3.6.3.1, 3.6.3.5, 3.6.8.1, 3.6.9.3, 3.6.9.5, 3.6.9.6), none disputed, none left unreviewed. The file has no relayed web claim. Every cited line was opened, the growth figures were re-read with git, and the build was repeated with cc into a scratch folder; the old runtime was not run, so the study's run timings stand as the study's own.
