n: 9.5.6.9
kind: review
re: 3.6.1.9
saw: e61d267b
ack: node
is: The eleven repaired branches concern held string indices, and strings do not move. The note says the string pass at the end of the collector frees unmarked slots for reuse, 'Live strings NEVER move', and the hazard is 'an arm holding a string INDEX in a C local across a later child walk - eleven arms' (memory/reference-len-walks-and-page-profiling.md:25-31). The node should give two causes: pairs are moved by the copying collector at 90% fill (fkwu-uni.c:6438-6446), and unreferenced strings are freed in the same pass.
limit: The float pool and the longjmp sentences hold as written (fkwu-uni.c:22953-22956, 23613-23640).
by: r3/review-fkwu-runtime
at: 2026-11-24

n: 9.5.6.10
kind: review
re: 3.6.2.1
saw: 5d5db7a2
ack: node
is: The page size does not hold for every emitter. 16 KB is the C leaf's page (FK_F64_PAGE_BYTES, fkwu-uni.c:12330-12331, used at 14435); the in-language emitter's page is its word count rounded up to whole host pages (10485-10486, 10492), the in-memory leaf likewise (5419, 5430), and the C leaf of tag 215 maps 4,096 bytes (5618). The node should say a function compiled by the C emitters of 3.6.2.2 gets one 16 KB page and the other producers size the mapping to their code.
limit: The 20 lines (fkwu-uni.c:4910-4929), the flags and the carrier's 27 lines (membrane-boot.c:558-584) hold.
by: r3/review-fkwu-runtime
at: 2026-11-24

n: 9.5.6.11
kind: review
re: 3.6.2.2
saw: 95517de7
ack: node
is: (1) The second trigger is every 1,024th call of any function not called as a closure, on the call and the tail-call path (fkwu-uni.c:10379, 10403); a body without a self call is compiled as a typed expression (15062, 14838-14844). (2) Not the first signature only: a function is 'compiled once per parameter signature', a primary instance plus FK_F64_XINST 3 more (564-567, 14967-14990, 11083-11094); the comment at 12475-12476 is outdated. (3) A third C emitter stands outside these lines: for tag 215 C 'emits the same tiny register-only image itself' (4883-4885, 5600-5602).
limit: These hold: 1,024 float boxes (12313-12328, 1062), 24 slots (12342), 8 string literals (12367), 6 parameters for the typed emitters (14844, 15065; the all-float leaf takes up to 8, line 14415), install on Apple arm64 only (14434-14463), numbered refusal codes (the note's line 13).
by: r3/review-fkwu-runtime
at: 2026-11-24

n: 9.5.6.12
kind: review
re: 3.6.2.3
saw: cc9e8439
ack: node
is: 'Not asked again' holds only for a body marked -1 (the comment at fkwu-uni.c:12325-12326). A refusal with a code below -1 is reopened when a later call's argument shape differs from the refused one, at most FK_F64_REASK 4 times per function (15023-15046: 'A refusal is a verdict on the evidence it was given, not on the recipe'), and a function declined because its callee was not yet compiled is set back to unasked (15019).
limit: These hold: the tag-194 node (12322-12323, 14457), the fallback to the original body on other argument types (12323-12325, 11079-11096), the unmapping of every page at a reload (12498-12511).
by: r3/review-fkwu-runtime
at: 2026-11-24

